OL,3,GNEWSAHow one of Birmingham's last
OL,4,Atimber-framed buildings was saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor centuries, timber-framed buildings
OL,7,Flined Birmingham's streets, but only a
OL,8,Fhandful remain in the city today.
OL,10,FThe 16th century Golden Lion, a lively
OL,11,Fpub that originally stood in Digbeth,
OL,12,Fhas finally been rescued from collapse
OL,13,Fafter being hidden behind scaffolding
OL,14,Ffor decades.
OL,16,FStanding in the city's Cannon Hill
OL,17,FPark, after being moved in 1911, the
OL,18,Fblack and white timber-framed building
OL,19,Fis one of the last surviving reminders
OL,20,Fof what many would consider to be "old
OL,21,FBirmingham".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
