OL,3,GNEWSAHow one of Birmingham's last
OL,4,Atimber-framed buildings was saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe structure's weathered oak beams
OL,7,Fhave survived civil war,
OL,8,Findustrialisation, a suffragette arson
OL,9,Fattack and two rescue missions to save
OL,10,Fit from disappearing altogether.
